1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,280
To finish, here are a few tips to get the most out of PadDeck.

2
00:00:04,980 --> 00:00:09,935
PadDeck adapts when you rotate your tablet, and it works on phones too,

3
00:00:09,935 --> 00:00:11,750
in portrait and landscape.

4
00:00:12,450 --> 00:00:16,192
Make it yours with themes like Dark, AMOLED, or Midnight,

5
00:00:16,192 --> 00:00:20,130
or pick your own colours with a colour picker or a hex code.

6
00:00:20,830 --> 00:00:25,215
Create profiles for different activities, like Work and Gaming,

7
00:00:25,215 --> 00:00:27,790
and switch between them with one tap.

8
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:31,276
Browse every installed app in the Apps section,

9
00:00:31,276 --> 00:00:34,300
and put the buttons you use most on your Home page.

10
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,354
Thanks for watching!

11
00:00:36,354 --> 00:00:40,347
You'll find the full user guide on the PadDeck GitHub page.

12
00:00:40,347 --> 00:00:41,430
Happy streaming!

